<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your sign-in link</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 40px;">

    <img src="{{emailBannerUrl}}" alt="FormaChat" width="480" style="width:100%; max-width:480px; display:block; margin:32px auto 28px; border:0;">

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 16px;">Hi there,</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 28px;">Click the button below to sign in to FormaChat. No password needed.</p>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 28px;">
      <a href="{{magicLinkUrl}}" style="display:inline-block; padding:13px 30px; background:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:15px;">Sign In to FormaChat</a>
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#777777; margin:0 0 4px;">This link expires in 10 minutes and can only be used once.</p>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#777777; margin:0 0 20px;">If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#aaaaaa; word-break:break-all; margin:0;">
      Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:<br>
      {{magicLinkUrl}}
    </p>

    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #636b2f; opacity:0.25; margin:32px 0 20px;">

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; margin:0;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
